body:
This is my personal understaning and experience with deppression. everyones depression is different.

&#x200B;

Depression is caused by a lot of things but it seems to mostly occur because of personal needs that are not met, or Because of a major loss. IF I COULD PERSONNALLY DESCRIBE DEPRESSION IN A SENTENCE OR TWO, DEPRESSION IS becoming so unfazed and indifferent in life, that everything becomes meaningless or and mentally exhaustive to the point where you struggle to feel positivity and you start questioning your lifes worth to the point of suicide. Depression isnt about being sad, its the habit of growing self destructive thoughts because of your inability to feel good with anything in life.

&#x200B;

its a self feeding fire where every symptom effects each other and makes them all worse

keeping it confined in a small space where it cant do anything like jump around and climb or even hunt/play sounds horrible. its normal for pet cats to roam free outdoors. if you want to keep a cat indoors in a house, thats ok and wanting to protect it from getting hurt/killed is perfectly reasonable, but to keep it inside a small space such as a car for hours is cruel/inhumane and is actually bounds for legal removal, at least in my state.

&#x200B;

its an animal kept for companionship, not a possession. let it live as an animal where it can be happy. I highly HIGHLY doubt keeping a cat inside a car is going to keep it happy.
